join Naledi (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Naledi (Aggravated)
- What's in there?
	Hope: What's in there?
	Naledi: Bongani's machine. Treadle. He used it more than I did — he was better at it, which annoyed me considerably at the time.
	Naledi: It'll be seized solid. Three years in a trunk in this climate.
	- Do you want to get it out?
		Hope: Do you want to get it out?
		Naledi: I want to see if it turns.
		Naledi: That's all. I'm not deciding anything today.
		set {GameState.quest_naledi_treadle_rediscovery} = "active"
		[signal arg="objective:Help clear the storage space around the machine; find oil and a spare bobbin"]
